    "displayName": "Direct Cargo Haul",
    "titleSource": "token_template_cleaned",
    "titleConfidence": "medium",
    "briefing": "Hiya, \n\nHere’s the deal, I need someone good for a special run. We’ve got an important client that’s threatening to take their business elsewhere, because their deliveries are consistently missing cargo. They’re demanding that 100% of the cargo be delivered on this run, or they won’t pay. Since this was before my time and my supervisor wants to show that it won’t happen again, they agreed with this. Anyway, I think you might be a good fit. \n\nIf you’re willing to take that risk too, here are all the pertinent details. The cargo can be collected from [Location] and delivered to [Destination]. Looks like the largest cargo container you’ll need to handle is [MissionMaxSCUSize], so be sure to bring a ship big enough and a handheld tractor beam to help you move those containers around.  \n \n[Contractor] \n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'\n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.",
